OSRS Agent
==========

Third-party content
-------------------

This project retrieves, chunks and displays text from the Old School RuneScape Wiki
(https://oldschool.runescape.wiki), whose content is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0 license (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/

  * Attribution: every answer cites the wiki pages it used (title and URL).
  * NonCommercial: the wiki text, and any database or index derived from it, may not be used
    commercially.
  * ShareAlike: derivative works of the wiki text must be distributed under the same license.
  * Changes: wikitext is converted to plain text, split into chunks and embedded as vectors.

Live Grand Exchange prices come from the OSRS Wiki real-time prices API
(https://prices.runescape.wiki), used with a descriptive User-Agent as that service requires.

